    <group name="area_mirror" color="0.5 0.5 0.5">
mirrors player inside this area against plane described in transform point
<target key="target" name="Target">Targetname of entity to activate/target.</target><string key="classname" name="Classname" value="area_mirror">The classname of the entity.</string></group>
    <group name="snd_reverb_zone" color="0.5 0.5 0.5">
Plays fmod snapshop when entering. Can override each other.
